msgid "Scopri la piattaforma"
msgstr "Discover the platform"

msgid "La piattaforma italiana della Citizen Science"
msgstr "The Italian Citizen Science platform"

msgid "Citizen Science Italia"
msgstr "Italian Citizen Science"

msgid "testo_home"
msgstr "Whether you're a curious enthusiast wanting to discover Citizen Science activities in your area or field of interest, a teacher looking for ideas for your class, a journalist seeking stories and insights on the role of citizens in scientific research, or a researcher who wants to give visibility to your project… you're in the right place!<br>"
        "Here you can not only <strong>find projects, initiatives and Citizen Science events</strong>, but also publish and share your own: tell your story, promote your activity and engage new participants in the production of open, collaborative scientific knowledge."

msgid "Cerca Progetti, Attività, Organizzazioni, Utenti"
msgstr "Search Projects, Activities, Organizations, Users"

msgid "Cerca"
msgstr "Search"

msgid "Cosa puoi fare qui"
msgstr "What you can do here"

msgid "Accedi"
msgstr "Login"

msgid "card_accedi"
msgstr "Contribute to CitizenScience.it with your content. Log in with your credentials or create your profile."

msgid "Il tuo profilo"
msgstr "Your profile"

msgid "Crea"
msgstr "Create"

msgid "card_crea"
msgstr "Insert a  <a class='text-olive-200' href='/newProject'>project</a>, a single <a class='text-olive-200' href='/newProject'>activity</a>, a <a class='text-olive-200' "
        "href='/new_blog'>news</a> or an  <a class='text-olive-200' href='/new_event'>event</a>. Share it with the CitizenScience.it community"

msgid "Esplora"
msgstr "Explore"

msgid "card_esplora"
msgstr "Discover the projects, activities, organizations, and users featured on the portal."

msgid "Cerca progetti"
msgstr "Search projects"

msgid "Gli ultimi progetti"
msgstr "Last projects"

msgid "Eventi"
msgstr "Events"

msgid "Approvato" 
msgstr "Approved"

msgid "Non Approvato"
msgstr "Not Approved"

msgid "Continua a leggere"
msgstr "Continue"
